 (4).png", "id": "1327505929431978", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304305_1327505932765311_5286460740341237931_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_0MsY8PO0IEQ7kNvwHzxbWS&_nc_oc=Adpak8Qwc1yDW7xQ8cKt4d2ZY43CJivx3yCt6PCQl5v9pyQgfGhS9Pi848ygjsU8OBM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP4wFjjwnfNNIUR0vuNwbm0mFOzCLeYmWH1EMUUWVghWw&oe=6ABFD8A4"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (33).png", "id": "2076724189787348", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_2076724193120681_4871879008737988130_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SeGKBfwC-qEQ7kNvwHFb17m&_nc_oc=AdqVIk24N0IkpLshepZ_hHhm9J0jxRbkO230EYAKG_WxzK-5QFqb0qlb0qbTc-LjeWA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMn8a0jOeBZjD3rsFN_u7uEPS92LBenCewQX1bpH1osEA&oe=6ABFB3D7"}, {"file_name": "HighresScreenshot00033.png", "id": "3932380693732122", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499304938_3932380697065455_5087597325838508038_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cW3JyRv05JQQ7kNvwHmrvG4&_nc_oc=AdpTRQxH0a07mXkj155l2NksX2T3JFvzlzvtfYF8ztOBZEQ44iYqMgSrSc_5gnIRvj8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPIhNoZ6icdpzxwL9leneDrd9m1RpIKGKU85-QZ9usnMw&oe=6ABFCAE2"}, {"file_name": "Untitled (34).png", "id": "890620570035576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_890620573368909_3665044860292886222_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pkwXZ3eXtDUQ7kNvwFrISKn&_nc_oc=AdpfAM-s8bBUbFsaCkmjeA2Nzr-sYdmy8N3eopb4jSZbE14UiWNMW0Ln2lXVn6PMmcY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM_Mz5D9ywiHqHBsMccP9vCpx0ObIFmodsN4NmqdDnsAA&oe=6ABFC5DB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Zbonk_2.0_Part-1_KeyArt_2560x1440.png", "id": "3470412146474631", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_3470412149807964_2463849604663011550_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b7bpD1-enTkQ7kNvwFwdM_G&_nc_oc=AdrKbuuNKtnObFDjg4R1v5pEHyVYmicfHgRD3BFmlmvtZTOJhucjaNtQ9SqQGHexpzI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOHCsmWrpvvlPzCU7ZyZl4d2ErZ_vhDbD-6A4fFj0U5vg&oe=6ABFC8A0"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://w